Feel free to use any given weapon/enchant/armor combo regardless of how rare it is perceived to be
Enchantment exclusions / legality
Warped cannot be double-enchanted.
Therefore Warped + Brawny is illegal.
Warped removes the other enchantment rather than allowing a second enchant.
Mythical cannot be double-enchanted.
Legendary upgrades into Mythical.
Therefore Legendary + Brawny is not a valid final build.
Blessed and Enlightened cannot be combined.
They belong to the same enchant family/ascended group.
Tenacious + Ferocious cannot be combined on one item.
Tenacious is unascended while Ferocious is ascended.
etc for every enchant that is the same one but ascended
Sacrificial + Ferocious can be combined.
Both are Ascended.
You cannot mix Ascended and unascended enchants on the same item.
The same enchant cannot be put twice on one item.
The same enchant can appear at most 5 times total, because you have 5 enchantable pieces.
You have 5 enchantable pieces total:
3 normal armor
Ring
Rune
Infused armor cannot be enchanted.
Armor exclusions / rules
You have:
3 normal equipped armor pieces
3 infused armor pieces
1 infused ring
1 ring
1 rune
Infused armor cannot be upgraded.
Infusion halves Boosts, but does NOT halve the perk.
Upgrading armor:
Positive Boosts ×1.5
Negative Boosts ×0.5
Armor perks and enchantment perks are separate categories.
Don't treat an armor-native perk as though it occupies an enchantment slot.
You may join 1 guild
The base attack speed with a 1 in attack speed is 1.4 attacks per second
The base attack speed of a weapon is calculated with taking the attack speed of the handle and blade you use and then averaging it, for example; the basic blade combined with the brass handle would give a base attack speed of 0.93
Builds can have the Shrine Of Balance which gives the following Scaling and Stat boosts: Tier 1: 3x Tier 2: 1.7x Tier 3: 1.4x Tier 4 1.1x Tier 5 Unaffected This applies to the unique handle and blade you use. This extra scaling can unlock weapon arts.
Weapons can have the hybrid bonus, when combining a blade and handle with completely different scalings the hybrid bonus gives a 1.5x increase to the weapons stat scalings, this does NOT unlock any extra weapon arts.
